sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant App as Express Application
    participant Disk as Origin Filesystem
    participant API as Cloudflare Purge API
    participant Edge as CDN Edge
    Admin->>App: Authenticated upload + X-CDN-Lab
    App->>Disk: Decode JPEG, write temp, rename
    App-->>Admin: New content hash; no purge yet
    Admin->>Edge: GET unchanged banner URL
    Edge-->>Admin: Old cached bytes if fresh HIT
    Admin->>App: POST purge /static/img/banner.jpg
    App->>API: Zone-scoped authenticated purge
    API-->>App: Success or failure
    App-->>Admin: Verified API acknowledgement or error
    Admin->>Edge: Reload and inspect actual response
    Note over Edge: Next state depends on propagation and caching
